01:15:19.900 --> 01:15:21.220
No, but they listen to you.

01:15:21.240 --> 01:15:22.780
So in some ways, you work for them.

01:15:23.340 --> 01:15:26.040
All right. That's depressing.

01:15:26.320 --> 01:15:27.640
But so is capitalism.

01:15:27.960 --> 01:15:29.960
We'll be back. See you later. Bye.
